ency code, e.g.: USD, EUR, JPY, BTC\", \"enum\": [\"USD\", \"EUR\", \"JPY\", \"GBP\", \"CNY\", \"BTC\"]}}, \"required\": [\"from_currency\", \"to_currency\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_exchange_rate_fixer\", \"description\": \"Get exchange rate using Fixer.io API, data sourced from European Central Bank\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"from_currency\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Source currency code, e.g.: USD, EUR, JPY\", \"enum\": [\"USD\", \"EUR\", \"JPY\", \"GBP\", \"CNY\"]}, \"to_currency\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Target currency code, e.g.: USD, EUR, JPY\", \"enum\": [\"USD\", \"EUR\", \"JPY\", \"GBP\", \"CNY\"]}, \"from\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Alias for from_currency\"}, \"to\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Alias for to_currency\"}}, \"required\": [\"from_currency\", \"to_currency\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_hotel_info\", \"description\": \"Get hotel's information\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"hotel_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Hotel name, e.g.: Hilton Tokyo, Marriott New York. Return all hotels if hotel_name is 'all'. Default is 'all'.\", \"default\": \"all\", \"enum\": [\"Hilton Tokyo\", \"Sheraton Paris\", \"Marriott New York\", \"Shangri-La Beijing\"]}}, \"required\": [\"hotel_name\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_market_status_alpha\", \"description\": \"Check if a major stock exchange is open using an Alpha-style provider.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"exchange\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Exchange code (e.g., 'NYSE', 'NASDAQ', 'LSE', 'HKEX', 'CRYPTO')\", \"enum\": [\"NYSE\", \"NASDAQ\", \"LSE\", \"HKEX\", \"CRYPTO\"]}}, \"required\": [\"exchange\"]}}, {\"name\": \"get_news_newsapi\", \"description\": \"Get latest news headlines using NewsAPI.org, most popular but free tier has limitations\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"category\": {\"type\": \"string\",